   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Hat Trick** (1 review): Hat Trick is track 10 on this recording [3]\n- **East Side** (1 review): East Side is track 12 on this recording [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Beatrix**: rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **Revolution**: rare: 14 archived performances [4]\n- **Eagles Chant**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Don's Place**: rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **Samba Pa Ti**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Cabriolet**: rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **Eagles Chant v2**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **East Side**: rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Soulive2025-01-31.AKGCK63.Flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 13 songs; 116 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **soulive2025-01-31**: source not stated; 12 songs; 116 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Microphones were clamped to the middle rail, twelve feet up [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Soulive2025-01-31.AKGCK63.Flac24**: taped by Rich Stoler; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: AKG CK63/c4860b > ZOOM F3 (32 Bit) [1]. Also: Transfer went from SD card through Audacity (slight amplification, normalizing, dithered to 16 bit), then CD WAV, FLAC, and tagging in Foobar2000 [1]\n- **soulive2025-01-31**: taped by Jeff Travitz [2]",
